#: qml/BugzillaPage.qml:62
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Trying to contact %1…"
msgstr "Pokušavam da stupim u vezu sa %1…"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:14
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Your Knowledge"
msgstr "Vaše znanje"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:18
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "Do you remember what you were doing prior to the crash?"
msgstr "Sjećate li se šta ste radili prije pada?"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:28
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Da"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:33
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Ne"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:42
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "Does the application crash again if you repeat the same situation?"
msgstr "Da li se program ponovo ruši ako ponovite iste radnje?"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:58
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "Please select which additional information you can provide:"
msgstr "Izaberite koje još podatke možete da pružite:"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:65
msgctxt ""
"@option:check kind of information the user can provide about the crash, %1 "
"is the application name"
msgid ""
"What I was doing when the application <application>%1</application> crashed"
msgstr "Šta je rađeno kada se program <application>%1</application> srušio"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:71
msgctxt "@action:check"
msgid "Unusual desktop behavior I noticed"
msgstr "Primijećeno neobično ponašanje površi"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:76
msgctxt "@action:check"
msgid "Custom settings of the application that may be related"
msgstr "Posebne postavke u programu koje mogu biti od značaja"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:85 qml/DeveloperPage.qml:262
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Not Sufficiently Useful"
msgstr "Nedovoljno korisno"

#: qml/ContextPage.qml:90
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The information you can provide is not considered helpful enough in this "
"case.\n"
"If you can't think of any more information, you can close the bug report "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Podaci koje možete pružiti ne smatraju se dovoljno korisnim u ovom slučaju.\n"
"Ako ne možete da se sjetite još nekih podataka, možete zatvoriti dijalog za "
"prijavljivanje greške."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:24
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Developer Information"
msgstr "Podaci za programere"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:30
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Install Debug Symbols"
msgstr "Instaliraj ispravljačke simbole"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:43
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Use this button to install the packages for missing debug symbols."
msgstr "Ovim dugmetom instalirate pakete za nedostajuće ispravljačke simbole."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:51
msgctxt "@action Report the bug on this domain"
msgid "Report on %1"
msgstr "Prijavi na %1"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:52
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Starts the bug report assistant."
msgstr "Pokreće pomoćnik za prijavljivanje grešaka."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:60
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Učitaj ponovo"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:62
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to reload the crash information (backtrace). This is useful "
"when you have\n"
"installed the proper debug symbol packages and you want to obtain a better "
"backtrace."
msgstr ""
"Ovim dugmetom ponovo učitavate podatke o padu (kontratrag). Korisno kada ste "
"u međuvremenu\n"
"instalirali potrebne pakete sa ispravljačkim simbolima i želite da dobijete "
"bolji kontratrag."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:72
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopiraj"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:73
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to copy the crash information (backtrace) to the clipboard."
msgstr "Ovim dugmetom kopirate podatke o padu (kontratrag) u klipbord."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:80
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Sačuvaj"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:82
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to save the crash information (backtrace) to a file. This is "
"useful if you want to take a look at it or to report the bug later."
msgstr ""
"Ovim dugmetom upisujete podatke o padu (kontratrag) u fajl. Korisno ako "
"želite da ih pregledate ili kasnije prijavite grešku."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:98
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This backtrace is very limited because there was not enough memory available "
"to generate a full backtrace. You can close some applications and try again."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj kontratrag je veoma ograničen jer nije bilo dovoljno memorije za "
"stvaranje punog kontratraga. Možete zatvoriti neke programe i pokušati "
"ponovo."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:103 qml/Main.qml:122
msgctxt "@action retry gathering crash data"
msgid "Retry"
msgstr "Pokušaj ponovo"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:128
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Error during the installation of debug symbols"
msgstr "Greška pri instaliranju ispravljačkih simbola."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:219
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Click the <interface>Install Debug Symbols</interface> button in order to "
"automatically install the missing debugging information packages. If this "
"method\n"
"does not work, read <link url='%1'>How to create useful crash reports</link> "
"to learn how to get a useful\n"
"backtrace, install the needed packages (<link url='%2'>list of files</"
"link>), then click the <interface>Reload</interface> button."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na dugme <interface>Instaliraj ispravljačke simbole</interface> da "
"bi se nedostajući ispravljački paketi automatski instalirali. Ako ovo\n"
"ne uspije, pročitajte <link url='%1'>„Kako sastaviti koristan izvještaj o "
"padu“</link> da saznate kako da dobijete upotrebljiv\n"
"kontratrag, instalirajte potrebne pakete (<link url='%2'>spisak fajlova</"
"link>), pa kliknite na dugme <interface>Učitaj ponovo</interface>."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:227
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Read <link url='%1'>How to create useful crash reports</link> to learn how "
"to get a useful backtrace, install the needed packages\n"
"(<link url='%2'>list of files</link>), then click the <interface>Reload</"
"interface> button."
msgstr ""
"Pročitajte <link url='%1'>„Kako sastaviti koristan izvještaj o padu“</link> "
"da saznate kako da dobijete upotrebljiv kontratrag, instalirajte potrebne "
"pakete\n"
"(<link url='%2'>spisak fajlova</link>), pa kliknite na dugme "
"<interface>Učitaj ponovo</interface>."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:234
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Try to regenerate the backtrace by clicking the <interface>Reload</"
"interface> button."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte ponovo da stvorite kontratrag klikom na dugme <interface>Učitaj "
"ponovo</interface>."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:237
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The backtrace generation failed to prepare. This indicates a severe problem "
"which you likely cannot resolve."
msgstr ""
"Priprema za stvaranje kontratraga nije uspjela. Ovo ukazuje na ozbiljan "
"problem koji vjerovatno ne možete sami da riješite."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:241
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<emphasis strong='true'>First install the debugger application (%1), then "
"click the <interface>Reload</interface> button.</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis strong='true'>Prvo instalirajte ispravljački program (%1), pa "
"kliknite na dugme <interface>Učitaj ponovo</interface>.</emphasis>"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:245
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The backtrace generation was stopped due to memory pressure. You could try "
"to regenerate the backtrace by clicking the <interface>Reload</interface> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Stvaranje kontratraga je zaustavljeno zbog nedostatka memorije. Možete "
"pokušati ponovo da stvorite kontratrag klikom na dugme <interface>Učitaj "
"ponovo</interface>."

#. i18nc here because that'd close the html tag but we need to append an unordered list of paths
#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:269
msgid ""
"The packages containing debug information for the following application and "
"libraries are missing:"
msgstr ""
"Nedostaju paketi koji sadrže ispravljačke podatke za sljedeće programe i "
"biblioteke:"

#: qml/DownloadSymbolsCheckBox.qml:20
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Automatically download debug symbols to enhance crash reports"
msgstr ""
"Automatski preuzimaj ispravljačke simbole radi boljih izvještaja o padu"

#: qml/DownloadSymbolsCheckBox.qml:29
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Crash reports can be of greater value if additional debugging resources are "
"downloaded from your distributor first.\n"
"This may also cause increased memory usage, will take longer, and causes "
"downloads of unknown size when a crash occurs. This is skipped automatically "
"when using a metered internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Izvještaji o padu mogu biti vredniji ako se prethodno preuzmu dodatni "
"ispravljački resursi od vašeg distributera.\n"
"To može povećati i zauzeće memorije, trajaće duže i izaziva preuzimanja "
"nepoznate veličine kada dođe do pada. Ovo se automatski preskače na vezi "
"koja se naplaćuje po protoku."

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:14
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Log in to the Bug Tracking System"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje u sistem za praćenje grešaka"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:66
msgctxt "@info:status '1' is replaced with the short URL of the bugzilla "
msgid "You need to login with your %1 account in order to proceed."
msgstr "Morate se prijaviti na nalog na %1 da biste nastavili."

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:71
msgctxt "@label:textbox bugzilla account email"
msgid "Email Address:"
msgstr "Adresa e‑pošte:"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:77
msgctxt "@label:textbox bugzilla account password"
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Lozinka:"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:84
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Save login information using the KDE Wallet system"
msgstr "Sačuvaj podatke za prijavu u KDE‑ovom sistemu novčanika"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:91
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<note>You need a user account on the <link url='%1'>KDE bug tracking system</"
"link> in order to file a bug report, because we may need to contact you "
"later\n"
"to request further information. If you do not have one, you can freely <link "
"url='%2'>create one here</link>. Please do not use disposable email "
"addresses.</note>"
msgstr ""
"<note>Za podnošenje izvještaja o grešci potreban vam je korisnički nalog u "
"<link url='%1'>KDE‑ovom sistemu za praćenje grešaka</link>, jer vam se "
"kasnije možemo obratiti\n"
"za još informacija. Ako nemate nalog, možete ga slobodno <link "
"url='%2'>otvoriti ovdje</link>. Ne koristite jednokratne adrese e‑pošte.</"
"note>"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:105
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Prijavi me"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:106
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to login to the KDE bug tracking system using the provided "
"email address and password."
msgstr ""
"Ovim dugmetom se prijavljujete u KDE‑ov sistem za praćenje grešaka, s datom "
"adresom e‑pošte i lozinkom."

#: qml/Main.qml:27
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>You cannot report this error, because <application>%1</application> "
"does not provide a bug reporting address.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ovu grešku ne možete prijaviti zato što program <application>%1</"
"application> ne navodi adresu za prijavljivanje grešaka.</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:34
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>As the Crash Handler itself has failed, the\n"
"automatic reporting process is disabled to reduce the\n"
"risks of failing again.<nl /><nl />\n"
"Please, <link url='%1'>manually report</link> this error\n"
"to the KDE bug tracking system. Do not forget to include\n"
"the backtrace from the <interface>Developer Information</interface>\n"
"page.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Pošto se sam rukovalac padovima srušio, proces\n"
"automatskog izvještavanja je isključen kako bi se smanjio\n"
"rizik ponovnog padanja.<nl /><nl />\n"
"<link url='%1'>Ručno prijavite</link> ovu grešku\n"
"na KDE‑ov sistem za praćenje grešaka. Ne zaboravite da priložite i\n"
"kontratrag sa stranice\n"
"<interface>Podaci za programere</interface>.</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:46
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>The reporting assistant is disabled because the crash handler dialog "
"was started in safe mode.<nl />\n"
"You can manually report this bug to <link>%1</link> (including the backtrace "
"from the <interface>Developer Information</interface> page.)</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Pomoćnik za prijavljivanje je isključen zato što je dijalog rukovaoca "
"padom pokrenut u bezbjednom režimu.<nl />\n"
"Možete ručno prijaviti ovu grešku na <link>%1</link> (zajedno sa "
"kontratragom sa stranice <interface>Podaci za programere</interface>.)</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:53
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>The reporting assistant is disabled because\n"
"the crashed application appears to have been updated or\n"
"uninstalled since it had been started. This prevents accurate\n"
"crash reporting and can also be the cause of this crash.</para>\n"
"<para>After updating it is always a good idea to log out and back\n"
"in to make sure the update is fully applied and will not cause\n"
"any side effects.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Pomoćnik za prijavljivanje je isključen zato što\n"
"je srušeni program izgleda ažuriran ili deinstaliran\n"
"otkad je pokrenut. To onemogućava tačno\n"
"prijavljivanje pada, a može biti i uzrok samog pada.</para>\n"
"<para>Poslije ažuriranja uvijek je dobro da se odjavite i ponovo\n"
"prijavite, kako bi ažuriranje bilo potpuno primijenjeno i ne bi\n"
"izazvalo nikakve sporedne efekte.</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:65
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>You can help us improve KDE Software by reporting this error.<nl /"
"><link url='%1'>Learn more about bug reporting.</link></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Prijavljivanjem ove greške možete nam pomoći da poboljšamo KDE‑ov "
"softver.<nl /><link url='%1'>Saznajte više o prijavljivanju grešaka.</link></"
"para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:95
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"There was not enough memory to gather crash information. You can close some "
"applications to free up memory and try again."
msgstr ""
"Nije bilo dovoljno memorije za sakupljanje podataka o padu. Možete zatvoriti "
"neke programe da oslobodite memoriju i pokušati ponovo."

#: qml/Main.qml:101
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Gathering crash information failed. You can close the window, or <link "
"url='%1'>view detailed output</link>."
msgstr ""
"Sakupljanje podataka o padu nije uspjelo. Možete zatvoriti prozor ili <link "
"url='%1'>pogledati detaljan izlaz</link>."

#: qml/Main.qml:106
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Gathering crash information failed for unknown reasons. You can retry, close "
"the window, or <link url='%1'>view detailed output</link>."
msgstr ""
"Sakupljanje podataka o padu nije uspjelo iz nepoznatih razloga. Možete "
"pokušati ponovo, zatvoriti prozor ili <link url='%1'>pogledati detaljan "
"izlaz</link>."

#: qml/Main.qml:109
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Gathering crash information failed for unknown reasons. You can retry, or "
"close the window."
msgstr ""
"Sakupljanje podataka o padu nije uspjelo iz nepoznatih razloga. Možete "
"pokušati ponovo ili zatvoriti prozor."

